title: "Controlled Randomness"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-26
authors:
  - family-names: Larin
    given-names: Artem
license: MIT
# Replace the placeholder with the actual repository URL before publishing.
repository-code: "https://github.com/your-username/controlled-randomness"
abstract: >-
  A research program on selection, observation, and randomness. Version 1.0
  provides a formal model, a reference implementation, a paired null
  experiment, and a preregistered protocol for testing whether a conscious
  observer can bias a live physical random source.
keywords:
  - randomness
  - selection
  - observer effect
  - quantum random number generator
  - preregistration
  - reproducibility
